                ['q' => 'When is pain a sign of something serious?', 'a' => 'Get medical help urgently for sudden severe pain, pain with fever, weakness or numbness, chest pain, or back pain with loss of bladder or bowel control. Pain that lasts more than a few weeks should also be examined.'],
